msgstr "Главни ВИ краулери су дозвољени у robots.txt."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2887
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2895
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4475
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4637
